{"path":"container/mdspan/layout_right/mapping/operator==","title":"operator==(std::layout_right::mapping)","titleHtml":"operator==<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::layout_right::mapping)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/mdspan/layout_right/mapping/operator==","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Compares two layout mappings of the same layout type based on their underlying extents.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OtherExtents <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> mapping<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> mapping<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OtherExtents<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two layout mappings of the same layout type based on their underlying extents. \n</p><p>Layout mappings <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> compare equal if both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">extents</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs.<span class=\"me1\">extents</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> are equal.\n</p><p>This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">extents_type<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">rank</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> OtherExtents<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">rank</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> layout mappings whose extents to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">extents</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">extents</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/mdspan/layout_left/mapping/operator==\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator==</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td